# Cloudflare Pages Single-Page Application (SPA) Configuration
#
# Client-side routing (React Router) for direct page navigation and refresh
# (e.g. /properties, /properties/:id, /admin, /admin/properties) is handled
# natively by Cloudflare Pages:
# - When no top-level 404.html exists in the output directory, Cloudflare Pages
#   automatically falls back to serving /index.html (200 OK) for all non-file requests.
#
# Note: Do not declare `/* /index.html 200` here. Cloudflare's Wrangler deployment
# validator flags wildcard rewrites targeting /index or /index.html as recursive
# infinite loops (Error code: 100324) due to automatic clean-URL extension stripping.
